      "cooked": "<p>Hi everybody,</p>\n<p>I’m sorry if the announcement on the main page already answered this and I’m just being dense. I ordered the next wave of Sentinels stuff (Enhanced Ed, IR, Unity, and Ambuscade) via the Pre-Orders in the store, and I’m not clear on when I should expect those to arrive. Will they be shipping with the GenCon stuff or will it be later? I’m totally cool if it is, I just want to know when I should start watching the porch for packages. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>",
